//#N i_fvgLiq1h = input.bool(true, "Intraday: fresh 1H FVG far edges as liquidity", group=gN, tooltip="Intraday model only: the far edge of every fresh 1H FVG (price has not traded into the gap) is swept liquidity, judged on 4H wicks. A 1H FVG stays sweepable for the 4H candles that open before price first enters it.")

