//#W i_swSweep = input.bool(true, "Swing: sweep must close back through the level", group=gW, tooltip="On (default): a swing sweep needs a wick through the level AND a close back the other way (high: close below the level; low: close above). Off: a wick through is enough. The intraday model always uses a wick.")
//#W i_swTrail = input.bool(true, "Swing: trail the stop to each new 1H swing after breakeven", group=gW, tooltip="After the stop has moved to breakeven (+R below), the stop follows each newly confirmed 1H swing high (short) / low (long) formed after the fill - 2 candles each side - whenever that tightens it. Off = breakeven only. Intraday never trails.")
